checker agent; none could be started in this run, so the check below is mechanical (a fresh
download of every source page, then a skeleton match of every quote) plus a second read of
each English position against its Arabic. The content-audit package re-checks all of this
with a fresh verifier. Nothing here is scholar-reviewed.

